<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>this is the wii page</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: sans-serif;
            line-height: 1;
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 0 10px;
            color: #AAA;
            background-color: #010101;
        }

        header {
            border-bottom: 2px solid #CCC;
            padding-bottom: 0px;
            margin-bottom: 0px;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #f0554a;
        }
        h2 {
            color: #f0554a;
        }

        a {
            color: #245bff;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        l {
            color: #0066cc;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        l:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .project-tag {
            background-color: #eee;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-family: monospace;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>The Wii who have seen many things</h1>
        <p style="color: #333">AKA the story of an abused wii</p>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section id="why">
            <h2>Why am i writing this?</h2>
            <div>I, back in october of 2024, had the weird idea of running as much different OSes as possible on my Nintendo Wii
            console (including EVERY version of Windows, see <a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/WiiHacks/s/Gpbeqmqui9" target="_blank">the reddit post</a> for more infos and images)</div>
        </section>



        <section id="quotes">
            <h2>Quotes of me and my friends</h2>
            <img src="quotes/me.png" width="320" height="160"></img>
            <img src="quotes/ari.png" width="320" height="160"></img>
            <img src="quotes/msthree.png" width="320" height="160"></img>
            <img src="quotes/wii.png" width="320" height="160"></img>
        </section>

        <img src="images/gtaonwiilmao.png" width="128" height="128"></img>

        <section id="technical">
        	<h2></h2>
        </section>

    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <p><small>Disclaimer: My Wii wasn't hurted in the process of making everything previously shown</small></p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>

